  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Electoral Reforms in Bangladesh</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;formes &#xe9;lectorales au Bangladesh</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Ce projet vise &#xe0; soutenir le programme de r&#xe9;formes du Bangladesh en renfor&#xe7;ant les capacit&#xe9;s institutionnelles, techniques et op&#xe9;rationnelles de la Commission &#xe9;lectorale du Bangladesh; en favorisant un environnement propice &#xe0; des &#xe9;lections cr&#xe9;dibles, inclusives et transparentes; et en facilitant une transition politique durable &#xe0; la suite des &#xe9;lections g&#xe9;n&#xe9;rales le 12 f&#xe9;vrier 2026.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to support the Bangladeshi reform agenda by strengthening the institutional, technical, and operational capacities of the Bangladesh Election Commission; fostering an enabling environment for credible, inclusive, and transparent elections; and facilitating a sustainable political transition following the general elections of February 12, 2026.</narrative>
  </description>
