   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expected Results</narrative>
    <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results expected</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">Les r&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s de ce projet comprennent : 1) la mise en oeuvre d&apos;un processus &#xe9;lectoral l&#xe9;gitime, inclusif et transparent gr&#xe2;ce au renforcement des capacit&#xe9;s institutionnelles, techniques et op&#xe9;rationnelles de la Commission &#xe9;lectorale du Bangladesh; 2) l&apos;instauration d&apos;un environnement favorable &#xe0; la tenue d&#x2019;&#xe9;lections, soutenant les droits de tous les citoyens &#xe0; participer &#xe0; des processus &#xe9;lectoraux pacifiques, inclusifs et transparents; 3) la transition politique facilit&#xe9;e, la durabilit&#xe9; de la gouvernance encourag&#xe9;e et la r&#xe9;silience renforc&#xe9;e.</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">The expected outcomes of this project include: (1) delivered a legitimate, inclusive, and transparent electoral process  through strengthened institutional, technical and operational capacities of the Bangladesh Election Commission; (2) supported an enabling environment for the conduct of elections that supports the rights of all citizens to participate in peaceful, inclusive and transparent electoral processes; and (3) political transition facilitated, governance sustainability promoted, and resilience strengthened.</narrative>
    </description>
   </indicator>
  </result>
